Hi,

I've uploaded the results of a bulk build for NetBSD/alpha 5.1 to

   ftp://ftp.NetBSD.org/pub/pkgsrc/packages/NetBSD/alpha/5.1_2010Q1/

A total of 7.1GB of packages were uploaded for a total of 7320
packages.

The source tree this was built from was updated Jun 4, 2010, and
the packages were built on a system running 5.1.

This is the first and last update for 2010Q1 for this
arch/os/os-version; the next update will be based on the 2010Q2
branch, and again using NetBSD 5.1 as the base OS.

